title: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Read and edit
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=draft
intro: The fifth tab, left side: the medical-necessity summary Scribe wrote, how sentences from applied actions and added clinical context appear, and how a person edits and saves it. It is the same summary Review & submit shows in New case: one text for each request, so an edit made in either place is read in the other.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Draft'"
screen dr "Draft\nLeft: 'Medical-necessity summary'. Right: 'Checks', 'Versions', send buttons"
process hd "Card subtitle\n'Version 3 · written by Scribe, checked by Integrity · every statement links to the chart'"
process sec "Four sections in a row, each with its source chips\n'Clinical picture.', 'Why a lower level of care is not safe.', 'Current severity.', 'Plan.'\nThe text is the request's draft in New case (before it has one, the text that draft would have)"
process cx "A fifth paragraph 'Context added.' when notes were added with 'Add clinical context'\nThe notes in the person's own words, no chips\nShown but not edited here: Edit has no box for it"
process nw "Sentences from applied actions follow in a green mark with a 'New' tag\nEach adds its own chip, e.g. 'Your answer'"
click ch "Click a source chip"
goto gC "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Source chip"

click ed "Click 'Edit'"
screen em "Edit mode\nOne text box per section, e.g. 'Edit Plan'\nHeader buttons 'Cancel' and 'Save changes'"
input ty "Change the text in one or more boxes"
click cn "Click 'Cancel'"
process cd "Edit mode closes\nNothing is saved"
click sv "Click 'Save changes'"
decision dCh "Did any box change?"
toast tn "'No changes to save'"
store sd "Edited sections saved\nThe edit keeps the sentences already added by applied actions\nNew version: 'Version 4', 'You', 'Edited by you'\nLog: 'You edited the draft. Integrity will read it again before it can be signed'\nThe same text is saved on the request's draft in New case, so Review & submit reads it"
toast ts "'Draft saved'\n'Integrity needs to read it again before it can be signed. Use Re-check.'"
process dy "'Every sentence matches the chart' now warns\n'You edited the draft. Integrity has not read it again yet.'\n'Send to payer' goes off"
process bd "Badge on the Draft tab goes up by one"
process lt "Actions applied later add their sentences after the edited text"
goto gK "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Checks, versions and send back"
goto gR "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"

s1 --> dr --> hd --> sec --> nw
sec --> ch --> gC
sec --> cx
dr --> ed --> em --> ty
em --> cn --> cd
em --> sv --> dCh
dCh -->|No| tn
dCh -->|Yes| sd --> ts
sd --> dy --> bd
dy --> gK
sd -.-> lt
sd --> gR
